              ],
              "description": "How an agent conducts itself in this harness: interaction modality and the order of a question, confirmation and its waivers, deletion only on confirmation, agent memory, communication language, untrusted input and unverified constraints, retries, where a thing goes, and getting started. Moved out of folio-core into the conduct topic (bean 9umr, owner ruling 2026-09-30); security is its sibling in the same topic.",
