              "title": "consulted: reference material nobody performs — a PRINCIPLE about graph semantics. Zero imperative markers and every heading is a claim — \"Not every edge is a dependency\", \"Provenance is three-valued\", \"Taint propagates down the dependency graph\". It is read before deciding how to traverse a graph; nobody performs it as a task."
